      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sawli ghwajoar fuga Amoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu gawa Nahashi bea eemeeda Amoni ak ghwascheang'da ak ghoang'waay Yabesh-gileyadi; ak gwayeesha gwayi fuga sean bea Yabeshi Nahashi, “Eesina duupcheeda sea agooga, ak gajeegadiyeeseegwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Nahasheeda Amoni saawa, “Aba ng'asheanji gaydasin duupcheeda sea agooga, ak gaydalootiida gheanyangeagwa sean bea geatinga dugwa, ak ghaanung' ghabwaspwas fuga sean bea Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha gweargwa Yabeshi niny, “Geaneasa eawooji ispwa ak abeeda geecheakti giijasoodiga gwasik jeeda ng'eanyiisean bea Israeli. Ama abeeda iimanda siida jea gwalealneasa, abeeda gajeapkaana headaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahidu giijasoodiga heeda Sawli aba Gibeya, gwarukusa ng'asheega iidiga buuneeda; ak gooyeawda buuneesean nea goojuur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Sawli ghwaan gwaleabu madamnyeanda nea gooweaku heewga; ak gwayi Sawli, “Gwandaani, anda buuneeda gooyeawda?” Ak geerukusa niny ng'asheega fuga Yabeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwaan guroorooda ASEETA aba uurda heeda Sawli damanda iinya ng'asheesu, ak gwaheedu nyarastaanyi muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu yookeeda heewga, ak ghwalajaada gamaning'iidi ak ghwanung' ghwaat giijasoodiga jeeda ng'eanyiida sean bea Israeli, nea gwayeesha, “Siida wassean meana geeshta Sawli ea Samweli, abeeda gajeesima gili dugwaaschi!” Hean ghwahidu gharbeeda NG'UTAMIIDA badahuuka buuneeda, ak ghang'eataayda siyagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghabwada geat saawa aba Beseki, ghwahita fuga Israeli sagalamnyooji bughalaji samwagu, nea fuga Yuda ea sagalamnyooji diktam ea damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geeyeesha fuga siicheakta biigu, leabu Yabeshi, “Asi ayeeshiina fuga Yabesh-gileyadi: ‘Numuji nea ghabwarbwara aseeta, gajanyasa lealeanooda, gajeelealneegwa.’” Iidu nea ghwahidu fuga siicheakta ak gwarukusa fuga Yabeshi ng'asheesu, gahoosan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi fuga Yabeshi, “Numuji gajeapkaana headaang'u, ak gisimaneasa gididaahi gideaba ghwahit aba headaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweedida ghabwaashaada Sawli buuneeda ak ghwanung' ghoah geenga samwagu; iimuchu sakteayda duw gang'eesa museasooda, ak ghabwar fuga Amoni ea ghang'waaniit daknooda; ak fuga ghuh ghwadarda, ea eamudu gwandeayi fih iyeenya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha buuneeda Samweli, “Nih ng'eaha siida rugu gideaba, ‘Gaygoombaleasa Sawli?’ Eani fiisu, ak gajeenuuseada.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Sawli, “Manda siida jea eabwar askweareani, aba gideaba askweareani niyeadu NG'UTAMIIDA lealeanooda jeeda Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Samweli buuneeda, “Abeeni, eeweaya Gilgali ak geebiikti eembiida sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaweay buuneesean Gilgali, ak geembiit Sawli ghoah sugoocheanda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba Gilgali. Ak geabwar lukghumajeega was ghadooweeda bea hoyyoo aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gahoosan muuchi Sawli sea fuga sean bea Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
